 "defect_observations": [
  "Adaptedness convention (C001): the proofs of thm:p15-martingale-convex (annex 103-104, 'phi(X_n) is adapted') and thm:p15-supermartingale-switching (annex 586-587) assert adaptedness that the martingale definition (body 18-26) does not require. Their conclusions hold under the definition as written, so those components are judged covered, but the C001 repair also discharges these claims.",
